"[{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":44,\"ReplacementContent\":\"- **Unified Biography & Credentials Cards Layout**:\\n  - Merged the biography text and stat cards into a clean vertical stack of two horizontal cards (`.bio-stat-card`), completely eliminating inline underlines and visual clutter.\\n  - **Tag-Pill Dashboard Structure**: Replaced detailed sentences with short, scannable headers and styled tag pills (e.g. *AI Systems*, *SaaS*, *Brand Strategy*, *Scalability*) inside each card. This drastically reduces the text weight, creating a crisp, dashboard-style interface.\\n  - **Compact Typography & Spatial Hierarchy**: Optimized font sizes and padding across the cards to balance legibility with a highly compact layout (e.g. Badge value is `1.2rem` in an `84px` badge column, Card heading is `0.9375rem`, and tag pills are `0.68rem`). Sized down padding to `0.5rem` and gaps to `0.5rem` to keep the layout space-efficient.\\n  - Each card combines a visual metric badge on the left (`3+ Yrs`, `MBA`) and its corresponding scannable tags on the right.\\n  - Hovering a card triggers a warm HSL-themed border highlight and ambient card glow (Orange for Experience, Pink for MBA Branding).\\n  - Hovering also lights up individual tag pills with their matching accent colors.\\n- **Direct Right-Pane Project Glow Coupling**:\\n  - Hovering or focusing a unified credentials card highlights the matching case study cards in the right pane with a purple pulse glow (`.flash-highlight`), establishing an immediate connection:\\n    - **Experience**: Highlights all projects (*Yooki, Aura AI, Cendrol*).\\n    - **MBA Branding**: Highlights *Yooki* and *Aura AI*.\\n- **Staggered Visual Intro Showcase (On Load)**:\\n  - 900ms after load, a staggered sequence sequentially highlights each of the two unified cards and their matching right-pane case study cards. This provides immediate, non-intrusive feedback to help the user understand the interactive connection the moment they see it.\\n